planning-mds/features/F0021-native-react-semantic-shell-and-oidc-session/F0021-S0003-renew-once-and-bound-session-lifetime.md:31:Clock skew between BFF and IdP: renewal margin and token expiry checks tolerate skew within the verifier's existing leeway. A renewal racing a logout: logout wins and the renewed tokens are discarded and revoked (S0005). A principal disabled after sign-in: the next request is refused as in F0002 (`unauthenticated`), and the session is ended.
planning-mds/features/F0021-native-react-semantic-shell-and-oidc-session/F0021-S0003-renew-once-and-bound-session-lifetime.md:35:Entry: any authenticated request. No user action is needed for renewal. Idle-warning action: "Stay signed in" sends one request; result is the extended idle deadline shown in the status bar. Persistence evidence: session record timestamps (last activity, idle deadline, absolute deadline) observed before and after. Audit: renewal failures and server-ended sessions are recorded (event shape is Phase B).
planning-mds/features/F0021-native-react-semantic-shell-and-oidc-session/F0021-S0003-renew-once-and-bound-session-lifetime.md:51:S0001 (session), S0004 (what the user sees after `session_expired`), S0005 (logout race).
