planning-mds/features/F0021-native-react-semantic-shell-and-oidc-session/README.md:18:- ADR-0051 decision recorded 2026-11-08 - same-origin BFF with an opaque HttpOnly session cookie, server-held tokens and renewal, CSRF and origin checks, and upstream revocation on logout. No browser token storage. Formal acceptance needs section 121.2 items 8 and 9.
